@startuml
title Content Authoring Flow

actor "Content Author" as Author
participant "Universal Editor" as UE
participant "SharePoint" as SP
participant "EDS Preview" as Preview
participant "Fastly CDN / Publish" as CDN

Author -> UE : Create/Edit page (blocks)
UE -> SP : Save content (markdown/blocks)
SP -> UE : Confirm saved
UE -> Preview : Trigger preview build
Preview -> SP : Fetch latest content
Preview -> Author : Show preview
Author -> UE : Publish
UE -> SP : Mark as published
SP -> EDS : Notify (or EDS polls)
EDS -> CDN : Publish to Fastly (invalidate/push)
CDN -> Users : Live content served

@enduml